{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🧩 WUfB - Driver Compliance Report\n\nQuesto workbook traccia lo stato di installazione e gli alert dei **driver e firmware** distribuiti via Windows Update for Business.\n\n**Sorgenti**: `UCClientUpdateStatus`, `UCServiceUpdateStatus`, `UCUpdateAlert`, `UCClient` (filtro `UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"`).\n\n> **Filtro Tipo PC:** di default vengono mostrati solo i **PC Modern**, intesi come macchine **Windows 11** il cui hostname inizia per `MP5`, `WP5`, `KP5`, `TP5`, `MS5`, `WS5`, `KS5` o `TS5`. Imposta *Tipo PC = Tutti i PC* per includere anche gli altri dispositivi.\n\n> **Nota v3:** rimossi i filtri e le colonne `UpdateManufacturer`, `DeviceManufacturer` e `DeviceModel`. `DeviceManufacturer`/`DeviceModel` non sono garantiti disponibili in `UCClient` su tutti i workspace (il dato anagrafica device va recuperato da `IntuneDevices`), e non è stata trovata traccia di `UpdateManufacturer` popolato in modo affidabile.\n\n> **Nota v4:** allineata la definizione di **PC Modern** a quella della KB Compliance Report: richiede Windows 11 *e* hostname con prefisso MP5/WP5/KP5/TP5/MS5/WS5/KS5/TS5 (in precedenza bastava non essere Windows 10).\n\n> **Nota v5:** aggiunto il filtro per nome driver. La vista **Stato Installazione per Device + Driver** applica i filtri ClientState, Nome Driver e Nome PC e mostra anche l'ultimo alert correlato, incluso lo stato dell'eventuale errore.\n\n> **Nota v6:** la vista **Stato Client e Alert per Device** include i filtri Alert Status, Alert Classification e Alert Subtype."
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-1111-4a1a-b1c1-111111111111",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 7776000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 2592000000
            },
            "label": "Intervallo Temporale"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-5555-4a1a-b1c1-555555555555",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ClientStateFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "jsonData": "[\"Installed\",\"Installing\",\"Offering\",\"OnHold\",\"Canceled\",\"Unknown\"]",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Filtro ClientState"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-6666-4a1a-b1c1-666666666666",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "OSVersionFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)\n| distinct OSVersion\n| where isnotempty(OSVersion)\n| order by OSVersion desc",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OS Version"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2b2f002-9999-4b2b-c2d2-999999999999",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ModernOnly",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "datatable(value:string, label:string, selected:bool)\n[\n  'modern', 'Solo PC Modern (Windows 11, hostname MP5/WP5/KP5/TP5/MS5/WS5/KS5/TS5)', true,\n  'all', 'Tutti i PC', false\n]",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Tipo PC"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-7777-4a1a-b1c1-777777777777",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DeviceNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Filtro Nome PC (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-8888-4a1a-b1c1-888888888888",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DriverNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Filtro Nome Driver (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-9991-4a1a-b1c1-999999999991",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AlertStatusFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == 'DriverUpdate'\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertStatus) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != 'Deleted'\n| distinct AlertStatus\n| where isnotempty(AlertStatus)\n| order by AlertStatus asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Filtro Alert Status (vista Client/Alert)"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-9992-4a1a-b1c1-999999999992",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AlertClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == 'DriverUpdate'\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertStatus, AlertClassification) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != 'Deleted'\n| distinct AlertClassification\n| where isnotempty(AlertClassification)\n| order by AlertClassification asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Filtro Alert Classification (vista Client/Alert)"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-9993-4a1a-b1c1-999999999993",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AlertSubtypeFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == 'DriverUpdate'\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertStatus) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != 'Deleted'\n| distinct AlertSubtype\n| where isnotempty(AlertSubtype)\n| order by AlertSubtype asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Filtro Alert Subtype (vista Client/Alert)"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📊 Compliance per singolo driver\n\nOgni riga rappresenta uno specifico driver. La percentuale è calcolata esclusivamente sui device che hanno riportato uno stato per quel driver; i contatori degli stati sono quindi mutuamente esclusivi."
      },
      "name": "text-section-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _state    = dynamic([{ClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _driver   = \"{DriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| summarize\n    ReportingDevices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    Installed = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installed\"),\n    Installing = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installing\"),\n    Offering = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Offering\"),\n    OnHold = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"OnHold\"),\n    Canceled = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Canceled\"),\n    Unknown = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Unknown\")\n    by UpdateId, UpdateDisplayName\n| extend PercentInstalledReported = round(todouble(Installed) / todouble(ReportingDevices) * 100, 1)\n| project\n    UpdateId,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    ReportingDevices,\n    Installed,\n    Installing,\n    Offering,\n    OnHold,\n    Canceled,\n    Unknown,\n    PercentInstalledReported\n| order by ReportingDevices desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance per driver tra device con stato riportato",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "PercentInstalledReported",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "palette": "redGreen"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "ReportingDevices",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-compliance-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🖥️ Stato Installazione per Device + Driver\n\nUsa i filtri **ClientState**, **Nome Driver** e **Nome PC** per restringere il dettaglio. Le colonne alert mostrano l'ultimo evento correlato tramite `AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId`, incluso se è ancora Active o già Resolved. Se più alert hanno lo stesso timestamp, viene mostrato prima quello Active con classificazione più grave; la vista successiva resta il riferimento per tutti i subtype attivi."
      },
      "name": "text-section-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _state    = dynamic([{ClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _driver   = \"{DriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion, OSBuild, LastWUScanTime) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion, OSBuild, LastWUScanTime;\nlet alertCandidates = materialize(\n    UCUpdateAlert\n    | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n    | where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n    | where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n    | where AlertStatus != \"Deleted\"\n    | project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, TimeGenerated, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL\n);\nlet latestAlertTimes = alertCandidates\n| summarize AlertTime = max(TimeGenerated) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId;\nlet alertInfo = alertCandidates\n| join kind=inner latestAlertTimes on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where TimeGenerated == AlertTime\n| extend AlertPriority = case(\n    AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Error\", 3,\n    AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Warning\", 2,\n    AlertStatus == \"Active\", 1,\n    0\n)\n| summarize arg_max(AlertPriority, AlertTime, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| extend URL = iff(isempty(URL) or URL startswith \"http\", URL, strcat(\"https://\", URL))\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertTime, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, DeviceName, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ClientState, ClientSubstate, OfferReceivedTime, RestartRequiredTime, UpdateInstalledTime) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| join kind=leftouter alertInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    OSVersion,\n    OSBuild,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    UpdateClassification,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    AlertType,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    ErrorCode,\n    ErrorSymName,\n    Recommendation,\n    URL,\n    AlertTime,\n    OfferReceivedTime,\n    RestartRequiredTime,\n    UpdateInstalledTime,\n    LastWUScanTime,\n    TimeGenerated\n| order by DeviceName asc, UpdateDisplayName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Stato Driver per Device",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ClientState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installed",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installing",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Unknown",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "UpdateClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Drivers",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Firmware",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertStatus",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Active",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Resolved",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "URL",
              "formatter": 7,
              "formatOptions": {
                "linkTarget": "Url",
                "linkLabel": "KB / docs"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## ❌ Driver in Errore o On Hold\n\nElenco dei driver in OnHold o con alert attivo. La correlazione usa AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId, chiave specifica degli aggiornamenti driver. I filtri Alert Status/Classification/Subtype sono dedicati alla vista **Stato Client e Alert per Device** più in basso."
      },
      "name": "text-section-errors"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _driver   = \"{DriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion;\nlet updates = UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| project DeviceName, AzureADDeviceId,\n          UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification,\n          UpdateId, TargetVersion, ClientState, ClientSubstate;\nlet alertInfo = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where AlertStatus == \"Active\"\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL;\nupdates\n| join kind=leftouter alertInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where ClientState == \"OnHold\" or isnotempty(AlertSubtype)\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    UpdateClassification,\n    TargetVersion,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    ErrorCode,\n    ErrorSymName,\n    Recommendation,\n    URL\n| order by DeviceName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Driver con errori o OnHold",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ClientState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "URL",
              "formatter": 7,
              "formatOptions": {
                "linkTarget": "Url",
                "linkLabel": "KB / docs"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-errors"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🚦 Stato Client e Alert per Device\n\nQuesta vista, precedentemente denominata **Stato Service-Side e Alert per Driver**, mostra insieme stato client, stato service e alert correlati tramite `AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId`. I filtri **Alert Status**, **Alert Classification** e **Alert Subtype** si applicano solo a questa vista; con *All* restano visibili anche i device senza alert. I valori dei menu rappresentano gli alert DriverUpdate correlabili disponibili nel workspace e nell'intervallo selezionato."
      },
      "name": "text-section-service-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _state    = dynamic([{ClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer    = dynamic([{OSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _alertStatus = dynamic([{AlertStatusFilter}]);\nlet _alertClassification = dynamic([{AlertClassificationFilter}]);\nlet _alertSubtype = dynamic([{AlertSubtypeFilter}]);\nlet _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _driver   = \"{DriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion;\nlet updates = UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| project DeviceName, AzureADDeviceId, UpdateDisplayName,\n          UpdateId, ClientState, ClientSubstate;\nlet serviceInfo = UCServiceUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, ServiceState, ServiceSubstate, OfferReadyTime, DeploymentName, PolicyName;\nlet alertInfo = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != \"Deleted\"\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode;\nupdates\n| join kind=leftouter serviceInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| join kind=leftouter alertInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_alertStatus) or AlertStatus in (_alertStatus)\n| where \"*\" in (_alertClassification) or AlertClassification in (_alertClassification)\n| where \"*\" in (_alertSubtype) or AlertSubtype in (_alertSubtype)\n| extend Note = case(\n    ClientSubstate in (\"PendingRestart\", \"RestartRequired\", \"PendingReboot\"), \"AwaitingRestart\",\n    ClientState == \"Installed\" and (isempty(AlertSubtype) or AlertStatus != \"Active\"), \"OK - Installed\",\n    ClientState == \"Installing\" and (isempty(AlertSubtype) or AlertStatus != \"Active\"), strcat(\"In progress: \", ClientSubstate),\n    ClientState == \"Offering\" and (isempty(AlertSubtype) or AlertStatus != \"Active\"), \"Offered, not yet started\",\n    ClientState == \"OnHold\", \"On hold (safeguard/policy)\",\n    \"\"\n)\n| project\n    DeviceName,\n    UpdateDisplayName,\n    ClientState,\n    ClientSubstate,\n    ServiceState,\n    ServiceSubstate,\n    DeploymentName,\n    PolicyName,\n    AlertSubtype,\n    AlertClassification,\n    AlertStatus,\n    ErrorCode,\n    Note\n| order by DeviceName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Stato Client e Alert per Device",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ServiceState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Pending",
                    "representation": "pending",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Warning",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertStatus",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Active",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Resolved",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "DeviceName",
              "sortOrder": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-service-alerts"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📦 Inventario Driver Installati"
      },
      "name": "text-section-inventory"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _device   = \"{DeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _driver   = \"{DriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| where ClientState == \"Installed\"\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| summarize\n    Installations = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    LastInstall = max(UpdateInstalledTime),\n    FirstSeen = min(UpdateInstalledTime)\n    by UpdateDisplayName, TargetVersion\n| order by Installations desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Driver installati nella finestra selezionata",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "Installations",
              "formatter": 4,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "palette": "blue"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "Installations",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-inventory"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Note\n- I dati riflettono l'ultimo stato noto per AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId.\n- Gli errori sono ricostruiti tramite UCUpdateAlert.\n- Le correlazioni service/alert usano AzureADDeviceId + UpdateId.\n- PercentInstalledReported usa come denominatore solo i device che hanno riportato quello specifico driver."
      },
      "name": "text-footer"
    }
  ],
  "fallbackResourceIds": [],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json",
  "styleSettings": {},
  "fromTemplateId": "custom-wufb-driver-compliance"
}
